{"route":"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/","title":"Sampling Methods | Data Foundations Tutorial","description":"Sampling design controls who has a chance to appear in the data. Compare probability and non-probability methods and learn when each can or cannot support generalization.","canonical":"https://datalearninghub.netlify.app/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/","bodyAttrs":{"data-page":"tutorial-chapter","data-tutorial":"data-foundations","data-chapter":"sampling-methods"},"mainHtml":"<main id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"tutorial-layout\">\n<aside class=\"tutorial-sidebar\" id=\"tutorial-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-head\">\n<a class=\"tutorial-course-title\" data-bn=\"ডেটা ফাউন্ডেশন\" data-en=\"Data Foundations\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/\">Data Foundations</a>\n<button aria-label=\"Close chapter menu\" class=\"icon-button tutorial-drawer-close\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-close\" type=\"button\">×</button>\n</div>\n<label class=\"tutorial-sidebar-search\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Search chapters</span><input data-placeholder-bn=\"Chapter খুঁজুন…\" data-placeholder-en=\"Search chapters…\" id=\"tutorial-chapter-search\" placeholder=\"Search chapters…\" type=\"search\"/></label>\n<div class=\"tutorial-progress-mini\"><div><span data-bn=\"Course progress\" data-en=\"Course progress\">Course progress</span><strong id=\"tutorial-progress-label\">0/21</strong></div><div class=\"progress-track\"><span id=\"tutorial-progress-bar\" style=\"width:0\"></span></div></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Course chapters\" class=\"tutorial-chapter-nav\"><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"welcome-to-data-analytics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/welcome-to-data-analytics/\"><span>01</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা অ্যানালিটিক্সে স্বাগতম\" data-en=\"Welcome to Data Analytics\">Welcome to Data Analytics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-and-statistics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-and-statistics/\"><span>02</span><span data-bn=\"ডেটা ও স্ট্যাটিস্টিকস\" data-en=\"Data and Statistics\">Data and Statistics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"observations-variables-and-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/observations-variables-and-values/\"><span>03</span><span data-bn=\"Observation, Variable ও Value\" data-en=\"Observations, Variables, and Values\">Observations, Variables, and Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"rows-columns-tables-and-datasets\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/rows-columns-tables-and-datasets/\"><span>04</span><span data-bn=\"Row, Column, Table ও Dataset\" data-en=\"Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets\">Rows, Columns, Tables, and Datasets</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"categorical-and-numerical-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/categorical-and-numerical-data/\"><span>05</span><span data-bn=\"Categorical ও Numerical Data\" data-en=\"Categorical and Numerical Data\">Categorical and Numerical Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"discrete-and-continuous-data\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/discrete-and-continuous-data/\"><span>06</span><span data-bn=\"Discrete ও Continuous Data\" data-en=\"Discrete and Continuous Data\">Discrete and Continuous Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"measurement-scales\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/measurement-scales/\"><span>07</span><span data-bn=\"Measurement Scale\" data-en=\"Measurement Scales\">Measurement Scales</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-structures-and-formats\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-structures-and-formats/\"><span>08</span><span data-bn=\"Structured, Semi-structured ও Unstructured Data\" data-en=\"Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data\">Structured, Semi-structured, and Unstructured Data</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-sources-and-collection\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-sources-and-collection/\"><span>09</span><span data-bn=\"Data Source ও Collection Method\" data-en=\"Data Sources and Collection Methods\">Data Sources and Collection Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"population-sample-parameter-and-statistic\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><span>10</span><span data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"sampling-methods\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/sampling-methods/\"><span>11</span><span data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bias-confounding-and-error\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><span>12</span><span data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-quality-dimensions\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-quality-dimensions/\"><span>13</span><span data-bn=\"Data Quality Dimension\" data-en=\"Data Quality Dimensions\">Data Quality Dimensions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/missing-duplicate-invalid-and-outlier-values/\"><span>14</span><span data-bn=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid ও Outlier Value\" data-en=\"Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values\">Missing, Duplicate, Invalid, and Outlier Values</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"tidy-data-and-organization\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/tidy-data-and-organization/\"><span>15</span><span data-bn=\"Tidy Data ও Data Organization\" data-en=\"Tidy Data and Data Organization\">Tidy Data and Data Organization</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"frequency-tables-and-summary-views\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/frequency-tables-and-summary-views/\"><span>16</span><span data-bn=\"Frequency Table ও Summary View\" data-en=\"Frequency Tables and Summary Views\">Frequency Tables and Summary Views</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"analytical-questions-and-metrics\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/analytical-questions-and-metrics/\"><span>17</span><span data-bn=\"Analytical Question ও Metric Definition\" data-en=\"Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics\">Analytical Questions and Defining Metrics</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"exploratory-data-analysis-workflow\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/exploratory-data-analysis-workflow/\"><span>18</span><span data-bn=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\" data-en=\"Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow\">Exploratory Data Analysis Workflow</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"reproducible-analysis-and-documentation\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/reproducible-analysis-and-documentation/\"><span>19</span><span data-bn=\"Reproducible Analysis ও Documentation\" data-en=\"Reproducible Analysis and Documentation\">Reproducible Analysis and Documentation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/data-ethics-privacy-and-responsible-use/\"><span>20</span><span data-bn=\"Data Ethics, Privacy ও Responsible Use\" data-en=\"Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use\">Data Ethics, Privacy, and Responsible Use</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"mini-project-retail-data-audit\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/mini-project-retail-data-audit/\"><span>21</span><span data-bn=\"Mini Project: Retail Dataset Audit\" data-en=\"Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset\">Mini Project: Audit a Retail Dataset</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/data-foundations/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/data-foundations/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/data-foundations/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"sampling-methods\" data-tutorial=\"data-foundations\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 11 / 21\" data-en=\"Data Foundations · Chapter 11 of 21\">Data Foundations · Chapter 11 of 21</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Sampling Method\" data-en=\"Sampling Methods\">Sampling Methods</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Sampling design নির্ধারণ করে data-তে কার chance আছে। Probability ও non-probability method compare করুন এবং কখন generalization support করে তা শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Sampling design controls who has a chance to appear in the data. Compare probability and non-probability methods and learn when each can or cannot support generalization.\">Sampling design controls who has a chance to appear in the data. Compare probability and non-probability methods and learn when each can or cannot support generalization.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 50 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Simple random, systematic, stratified ও cluster sampling explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain simple random, systematic, stratified, and cluster sampling.\">Explain simple random, systematic, stratified, and cluster sampling.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Convenience ও voluntary-response sample চিনুন।\" data-en=\"Recognize convenience and voluntary-response samples.\">Recognize convenience and voluntary-response samples.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Purpose অনুযায়ী sampling design বেছে নিন।\" data-en=\"Choose a sampling design for a purpose.\">Choose a sampling design for a purpose.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Coverage ও nonresponse concern identify করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify coverage and nonresponse concerns.\">Identify coverage and nonresponse concerns.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Probability sampling\" data-en=\"Probability sampling\">Probability sampling</h2><p data-bn=\"Probability sampling known random mechanism ব্যবহার করে যাতে প্রতিটি eligible unit-এর known, nonzero selection chance থাকে। Simple random direct; systematic random start-এর পর every kth; stratified important subgroup-এর মধ্যে; cluster natural group select করে।\" data-en=\"Probability sampling uses a known random mechanism so each eligible population unit has a known, nonzero chance of selection. Simple random sampling selects units directly; systematic sampling selects every kth unit after a random start; stratified sampling samples within important subgroups; cluster sampling selects natural groups and observes units within them.\">Probability sampling uses a known random mechanism so each eligible population unit has a known, nonzero chance of selection. Simple random sampling selects units directly; systematic sampling selects every kth unit after a random start; stratified sampling samples within important subgroups; cluster sampling selects natural groups and observes units within them.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Non-probability sampling\" data-en=\"Non-probability sampling\">Non-probability sampling</h2><p data-bn=\"Convenience, purposive, quota ও voluntary-response sample known selection probability দেয় না। Exploration, rapid feedback, expert case বা hard-to-reach group-এ useful, কিন্তু wider population generalization-এ caution ও limitation প্রয়োজন।\" data-en=\"Convenience, purposive, quota, and voluntary-response samples do not provide known selection probabilities. They can be useful for exploration, rapid feedback, expert cases, or hard-to-reach groups, but generalization to a wider population requires caution and explicit limitations.\">Convenience, purposive, quota, and voluntary-response samples do not provide known selection probabilities. They can be useful for exploration, rapid feedback, expert cases, or hard-to-reach groups, but generalization to a wider population requires caution and explicit limitations.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Stratification বনাম clustering\" data-en=\"Stratification versus clustering\">Stratification versus clustering</h2><p data-bn=\"Stratification প্রতিটি important subgroup থেকে representation নিশ্চিত করে এবং every stratum-এর মধ্যে sample নেয়। Cluster sampling কিছু group select করে, সাধারণত cost কমাতে। এদের confuse করলে analysis ও standard error ভুল হতে পারে।\" data-en=\"Stratification ensures representation from each important subgroup and samples within every stratum. Cluster sampling selects only some groups, often to reduce travel or cost. Confusing them can lead to incorrect analysis and standard errors.\">Stratification ensures representation from each important subgroup and samples within every stratum. Cluster sampling selects only some groups, often to reduce travel or cost. Confusing them can lead to incorrect analysis and standard errors.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-4\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">04</div><h2 data-bn=\"Sampling frame ও response\" data-en=\"Sampling frame and response\">Sampling frame and response</h2><p data-bn=\"Sampling frame হলো selection-এর operational list বা mechanism। Population-এর অংশ exclude হলে coverage error। Random sample-ও biased হতে পারে যদি selected people respond না করে এবং nonrespondent systematically differ করে।\" data-en=\"A sampling frame is the operational list or mechanism used to select units. If it excludes part of the population, coverage error occurs. Even a random sample can become biased if selected people do not respond and nonrespondents differ systematically.\">A sampling frame is the operational list or mechanism used to select units. If it excludes part of the population, coverage error occurs. Even a random sample can become biased if selected people do not respond and nonrespondents differ systematically.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Simple random sample\" data-en=\"Simple random sample\">Simple random sample</h3><p data-bn=\"Eligible unit randomly selected probability sample।\" data-en=\"A probability sample in which eligible units are selected randomly.\">A probability sample in which eligible units are selected randomly.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Stratified sample\" data-en=\"Stratified sample\">Stratified sample</h3><p data-bn=\"Defined subgroup-এর মধ্যে separately sample নেওয়া হয়।\" data-en=\"Samples are drawn separately within defined subgroups.\">Samples are drawn separately within defined subgroups.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Cluster sample\" data-en=\"Cluster sample\">Cluster sample</h3><p data-bn=\"Natural group sample, তারপর selected group-এর unit study।\" data-en=\"Natural groups are sampled, then units within selected groups are studied.\">Natural groups are sampled, then units within selected groups are studied.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Sampling frame\" data-en=\"Sampling frame\">Sampling frame</h3><p data-bn=\"যে list বা mechanism থেকে sample select করা হয়।\" data-en=\"The list or mechanism from which the sample is selected.\">The list or mechanism from which the sample is selected.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"দুই education center survey\" data-en=\"Surveying two education centers\">Surveying two education centers</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"Program student satisfaction estimate চায় এবং দুই center ও grade level represent করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"A program wants student satisfaction estimates and must represent both centers and grade levels.\">A program wants student satisfaction estimates and must represent both centers and grade levels.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Eligible student population define করুন।\" data-en=\"Define the eligible student population.\">Define the eligible student population.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Center ও grade অনুযায়ী stratum তৈরি করুন।\" data-en=\"Create strata by center and grade.\">Create strata by center and grade.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"প্রতিটি stratum-এর মধ্যে randomly sample করুন।\" data-en=\"Randomly sample within each stratum.\">Randomly sample within each stratum.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Selected, contacted ও responding student track করুন।\" data-en=\"Track selected, contacted, and responding students.\">Track selected, contacted, and responding students.</p></li><li><span>5</span><p data-bn=\"Sampling fraction বা response substantially differ করলে weight বা qualify করুন।\" data-en=\"Weight or qualify results if sampling fractions or response differ substantially.\">Weight or qualify results if sampling fractions or response differ substantially.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Stratification important subgroup representation protect করে, measurement বা nonresponse error remove করে না।\" data-en=\"Stratification protects representation of important subgroups but does not remove measurement or nonresponse error.\">Stratification protects representation of important subgroups but does not remove measurement or nonresponse error.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/data-foundations/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Probability sampling known random mechanism ব্যবহার করে।\" data-en=\"Probability sampling uses a known random mechanism.\">Probability sampling uses a known random mechanism.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Stratification সব defined subgroup-এর মধ্যে sample নেয়।\" data-en=\"Stratification samples within all defined subgroups.\">Stratification samples within all defined subgroups.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Cluster sampling কিছু natural group select করে।\" data-en=\"Cluster sampling selects some natural groups.\">Cluster sampling selects some natural groups.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Coverage ও nonresponse এখনও গুরুত্বপূর্ণ।\" data-en=\"Coverage and nonresponse still matter.\">Coverage and nonresponse still matter.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://openstax.org/books/introductory-statistics-2e/pages/1-2-data-sampling-and-variation-in-data-and-sampling\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">OpenStax — Data, Sampling, and Variation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.census.gov/topics/research/stat-research/expertise/survey-sampling.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">U.S. Census Bureau — Survey Sampling ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/population-sample-parameter-and-statistic/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Population, Sample, Parameter ও Statistic\" data-en=\"Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic\">Population, Sample, Parameter, and Statistic</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/data-foundations/bias-confounding-and-error/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Bias, Confounding ও Error\" data-en=\"Bias, Confounding, and Error\">Bias, Confounding, and Error</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}